"When enabled, images and videos in widget areas will automatically open in "
"the lightbox."
msgstr ""
"Keď je povolené, obrázky a videá v oblastiach widgetov sa automaticky "
"otvorí v lightboxe."

#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2738
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2738
msgid ""
"When enabled, images in WordPress [gallery] shortcodes and Gutenberg "
