msgstr "Farba textu pri prechode myšou nad tlačidlami \"Otvor v Lightboxe\"."

#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2852
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:2852
msgid ""
"Custom text for lightbox buttons. This text will appear on all \"Open in "
